<td style="text-align: center;">2</td>
<td>Jika login berhasil Sistem akan menampilkan halaman dashboard. Lalu pilih menu <strong>Internal (UMDS)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-pengaju/media/image4.png" style="width:3.49779in;height:1.45711in" /></td>
</tr>
